<div>
<p class="kicker rv">Membership</p>
<h1 class="rv">Your first session <em>is free.</em></h1>
<p class="lead rv">Getting started is simple. Just come along to a session that suits your age and experience. All you need is comfortable clothing, enthusiasm, and an interest in learning a great martial art.</p>
<div class="cta rv"><a class="btn" href="https://my.coacha.app/member_signup/E5IZPMG4D6">Become a member <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/website/#schedule">Class times</a></div>
</div>
<div class="hero-card rv"><div class="frame"></div><div class="ph"><image-slot id="join-photo" shape="rect" placeholder="Drop a photo of juniors on the mat" src="/website/assets/uploads/IMG-20250626-WA00021.jpg"></image-slot></div><div class="badge"><small>Kids 5+ · Adults</small>All levels</div></div>
</div>
