<section class="sec light" id="steps">
<div class="rail l"><span>三歩</span></div>
<div class="wrap">
<p class="kicker rv">How it works</p>
<h2 class="rv">Three steps to the mat</h2>
<div class="why steps">
<article class="rv"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Try a free session</h3><p>Pick a club night that fits your age and experience — Tuesdays and Thursdays for juniors and seniors, Mondays for advanced 14+. Turn up, watch or join in.</p><a href="/website/#schedule">See the schedule →</a></article>
<article class="rv"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Sign up online</h3><p>Choose a monthly plan below and complete your club membership through our Coacha portal in a few minutes. Train occasionally? Pay as you go instead.</p><a href="https://my.coacha.app/member_signup/E5IZPMG4D6">Open the sign-up form →</a></article>
<article class="rv"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Get your BJA licence</h3><p>As a British Judo Association club, members need a BJA licence to grade and compete. It includes insurance and covers you at any BJA club.</p><a href="https://www.britishjudo.org.uk/my-judo/membership/">BJA membership →</a></article>
</div>
</div>
