<div class="rail r"><span>月謝</span></div>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="card-head">
<div><p class="kicker rv">Monthly plans</p><h2 class="rv">Pick how often you train</h2></div>
<p class="lead rv" style="max-width:420px">Choose the plan that fits how often you train. If you train occasionally, feel free to attend and pay as you go — no subscription required.</p>
</div>
<div class="plans">
<div class="plan rv"><h3>Juniors / Students</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single session per week</span><b>£20<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£35<small>/mo</small></b></div><a class="btn teal" href="https://my.coacha.app/member_signup/E5IZPMG4D6">Sign up</a></div>
<div class="plan hot rv"><h3>Family (Juniors)</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single session per week</span><b>£35<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£60<small>/mo</small></b></div><a class="btn" href="https://my.coacha.app/member_signup/E5IZPMG4D6">Sign up</a></div>
<div class="plan rv"><h3>Seniors</h3><div class="opt"><span>Single weekly session</span><b>£30<small>/mo</small></b></div><div class="opt"><span>Unlimited sessions</span><b>£55<small>/mo</small></b></div><a class="btn teal" href="https://my.coacha.app/member_signup/E5IZPMG4D6">Sign up</a></div>
</div>
<p class="plans-note rv">Questions about which plan is right for you? <a href="/website/contact/">Contact us</a> — our coaches are always happy to guide you.</p>
</div>
