<section class="sec light" id="bja">
<div class="rail l"><span>免許</span></div>
<div class="wrap">
<p class="kicker rv">BJA licence</p>
<h2 class="rv">What your licence gives you</h2>
<p class="lead rv">Coventry Judo Club are members of the British Judo Association. To continue your judo journey you are required to gain your licence from the BJA too.</p>
<ul class="list rv">
<li><b>01</b><div><strong>Insurance</strong>You receive comprehensive public liability and personal accident insurance.</div></li>
<li><b>02</b><div><strong>Grading</strong>The ability to complete gradings, should you wish to progress through the belt ranks.</div></li>
<li><b>03</b><div><strong>Competitions</strong>The opportunity to participate in BJA events and more.</div></li>
<li><b>04</b><div><strong>Discounts</strong>Exclusive discounts from a range of high street retailers and brands.</div></li>
</ul>
<a class="btn rv" style="margin-top:32px" href="https://www.britishjudo.org.uk/my-judo/membership/">Get your BJA licence <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
</div>
</section>
